i operasional dasar. Komputer minimal prosesor Core i7/setara, RAM minimal 16 GB, SSD minimal 512 GB, monitor minimal 22 inci. Printer inkjet/laserjet standar kantor/lab. Garansi minimal 12 bulan sejak BAST.', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2952662);
